# Fonts of each use, tried in order for each letter. A bitmap font only takes
# the sizes that are whole multiples of its height: Terminus goes from the
# largest file to the smallest, so 24 takes ter-u24n and 48 takes it twice.
# DejaVu goes before the symbols: it is the font of the line at the sizes no
# Terminus fits. A use in ~/.config/tundra/fonts replaces its list here.

